Rubutu idan: ['html'] yi: { <- (
		kai
		musanya: ['&'] da: ['&amp;'],
		musanya: ['<'] da: ['&lt;'],
		musanya: ['>'] da: ['&gt;'],
		musanya: ['"'] da: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Jeri sabo.

['Verbatim Syntax'] haruffa kowane: { :lamba :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (lamba), Letter: letter).
}.

Fitarwa list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list haɗa: ['↵']).

Fitarwa rubuta: template.

